		"name": "API Rate Limiter Service",
		"description": "### API Rate Limiter Service\n\nThis collection provides requests for testing the API Rate Limiter Service and the protected Backend APIs.\n\n#### Features:\n- **Token Bucket Algorithm**: Standard algorithm for controlling rate in networking.\n- **Middleware (HandlerInterceptor)**: Enforces limits before requests reach controllers.\n- **Dynamic Rules**: Different limits for Users (X-User-Id), IP addresses, and generic requests.\n\n#### Required Headers for Backend APIs:\n- `X-User-Id`: Identifier for the client (e.g., `user-123`). If missing, fallback to IP-based limiting.\n\n#### Core Header Meanings:\n- `X-RateLimit-Remaining`: How many tokens are left for you in the current window.\n- `X-RateLimit-Capacity`: Total capacity of your bucket.\n- `X-RateLimit-Reset`: Seconds until the next token refill.\n- `Retry-After`: (Included on 429) Wait this many seconds before retrying.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
